**/bin

# liveprobe/ and livepeer/ moved to github.com/urnetwork/message. A clone that built them before
# the move still holds their binaries there (liveprobe, liveprobe-arm64 and each one's .exe, 34 to
# 50 MB apiece), and the rules that hid them left with the directories, so the first `git add -A`
# would stage them. Both directories stay ignored until no known clone holds one.
/liveprobe/
/livepeer/
build/apple*
build/ios*
build/android*
build/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/test.out
js/js

temp/*

.vscode/*
.direnv

# agent planning artifacts -- internal workflow, never shipped upstream
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/

# a compiled test binary was tracked at the repo root until 2026-09-24; `go test -c`
# writes one here by default and it is 20+ MB of build output, not source.
*.test
